  hasName: 1
  dialogue:
  - It seems you have chosen to fight for your life, good, I will show you exactly
    what you need to face the Lord of the Dead and fight for those you love the most
    in the world of the living.
  - First and foremost, you wield a spear, try swinging it around.
  - Hit me five times with it.
  responses:
  - responseText: Are you sure?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a844d4f087fd9894e8c0d4fc8f22a640, type: 2}
  - responseText: Understood.
